t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-41eaf383 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\\\" data-id=\\\"41eaf383\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"heading.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h3 class=\\\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\\\">Driver Lounge VIP<\\/h3>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-e252db09 e-con-boxed stitch-sec-testimonials e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"e252db09\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"e-con-inner\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-b703419c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\\\" data-id=\\\"b703419c\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"heading.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\\\">Bukti Kemitraan Nyata<\\/p>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-5dcf7398 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\\\" data-id=\\\"5dcf7398\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"heading.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h2 class=\\\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\\\">Dipercaya oleh Para Pemimpin Industri Ekspedisi &amp; Transportasi<\\/h2>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-28b6c94f e-con-full testimonials-row e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"28b6c94f\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-92235634 e-con-full testi-card-col e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"92235634\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-4914e6db e-con-full testi-card-col e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"4914e6db\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-43368863 e-con-full testi-card-col e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"43368863\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d57d541 e-con-boxed stitch-sec-faq e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"6d57d541\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" id=\\\"faq\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"e-con-inner\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-95147e7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\\\" data-id=\\\"95147e7e\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"heading.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\\\">Tanya Jawab Teknis<\\/p>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-1091e86a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\\\" data-id=\\\"1091e86a\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"heading.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h2 class=\\\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\\\">Pertanyaan Populer Seputar Layanan &amp; Kerjasama Fleet<\\/h2>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-8cb4ef1e faq-accordion-box elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\\\" data-id=\\\"8cb4ef1e\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"accordion.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-accordion\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-accordion-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2361\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"1\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2361\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-accordion-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Apakah Master Truck melayani servis panggilan atau darurat di jalan (Roadside Assistance)?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2361\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"1\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2361\\\">Ya, kami memiliki armada mobil bengkel keliling (Mobile Service Unit) dan truk derek underlift 25 ton yang beroperasi 24 jam setiap hari untuk evakuasi darurat, perbaikan ban, kelistrikan, serta masalah angin rem di wilayah Jabodetabek, Cikarang, Karawang, hingga jalur tol Trans-Jawa.<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-accordion-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2362\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2362\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-accordion-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Apa saja merek truk niaga yang dapat ditangani oleh bengkel Master Truck?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2362\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2362\\\">Bengkel kami menangani seluruh brand truk heavy duty dan medium commercial ternama, termasuk Scania, Volvo Trucks, Hino (500 &#038; 300 series), Mitsubishi Fuso, Isuzu Giga\\/Elf, Mercedes-Benz Axor, MAN, dan UD Trucks Quester dengan scanner diagnostik resmi.<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-accordion-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2363\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"3\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2363\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-accordion-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Bagaimana jaminan keaslian suku cadang dan garansi pengerjaan overhaul?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2363\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"3\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2363\\\">Kami memberikan jaminan 100% suku cadang orisinal OEM langsung dari distributor resmi. Untuk pengerjaan overhaul total mesin dan transmisi, kami memberikan garansi resmi pengerjaan hingga 180 hari atau 50.000 KM dengan sertifikat garansi tertulis.<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-accordion-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2364\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"4\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2364\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-accordion-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Bagaimana skema kerjasama Kontrak Pemeliharaan Armada (PMP) untuk perusahaan logistik?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2364\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"4\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2364\\\">Kami menyediakan kontrak perawatan fleksibel bulanan maupun tahunan. Perusahaan Anda akan mendapatkan alokasi stall prioritas (Zero Queue), diskon suku cadang hingga 18%, laporan digital inspeksi terintegrasi, serta fleksibilitas pembayaran termin bisnis (TOP 30-60 hari) setelah proses verifikasi kredit selesai.<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-accordion-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2365\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"5\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2365\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<i class=\\\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened Array\\\"><\\/i>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-accordion-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Apakah bengkel Master Truck memiliki fasilitas penyimpanan atau pool aman untuk truk yang menginap?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2365\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"5\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-2365\\\">Ya, area workshop kami seluas lebih dari 8.000 m\\u00b2 dilengkapi sistem pengamanan 24 jam dengan petugas sekuriti, CCTV aktif di setiap stall dan sudut area parkir, serta asuransi perlindungan unit selama kendaraan berada di dalam area bengkel kami.<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-be341111 e-con-boxed stitch-sec-cta e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"be341111\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"e-con-inner\\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7eec9c6 e-con-full final-banner-row e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"c7eec9c6\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-73d6d741 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"73d6d741\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-9dce6e3d e-con-boxed stitch-footer e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"9dce6e3d\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" id=\\\"kontak\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"e-con-inner\\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-9808b46f e-con-full footer-main-row e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"9808b46f\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-67c67a44 e-con-full footer-col-brand e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"67c67a44\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-236b6415 e-con-full footer-col-links e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"236b6415\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec37edda e-con-full footer-col-facility e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"ec37edda\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ab3d193 e-con-full footer-col-cert e-flex e-con e-child\\\" data-id=\\\"4ab3d193\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"0770de4013aa1cecb4394637a19d1919\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[\"elementor-frontend\"],\"styles\":[\"widget-image\",\"widget-heading\",\"widget-icon-box\",\"widget-accordion\"]}}');
