			<img width=\"533\" height=\"800\" src=\"http://localhost:5000/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/mt6-testi2.webp\" alt=\"Foto pelanggan armada\" srcset=\"http://localhost:5000/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/mt6-testi2.webp 533w, http://localhost:5000/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/mt6-testi2-200x300.webp 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" />																<h3>Pemilik Armada</h3>		<p>Usaha angkutan &mdash; Medan</p><p>★★★★★</p><p>&ldquo;Oli dan ban asli, harganya miring. Ngirit banyak buat perawatan truk kami.&rdquo;</p>													<img width=\"534\" height=\"800\" src=\"http://localhost:5000/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/mt6-testi3.webp\" alt=\"Foto pelanggan armada\" srcset=\"http://localhost:5000/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/mt6-testi3.webp 534w, http://localhost:5000/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/mt6-testi3-200x300.webp 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px\" />																<h3>Pengawas Armada</h3>		<p>Perusahaan logistik &mdash; Sumatera Utara</p><p>★★★★★</p><p>&ldquo;Truk mogok rem blong di Tebing Tinggi, langsung dijemput. Gerak cepat!&rdquo;</p>			<p>Tanya Jawab</p>					<h2>Sering Ditanyakan</h2>		<p>Masih ragu? Chat kami gratis &mdash; tanya-tanya dulu juga boleh.</p>								<a href=\"https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Master%20Truck,%20saya%20ingin%20bertanya\" target=\"_blank\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M380.9 97.1C339 55.1 283.2 32 223.9 32c-122.4 0-222 99.6-222 222 0 39.1 10.2 77.3 29.6 111L0 480l117.7-30.9c32.4 17.7 68.9 27 106.1 27h.1c122.3 0 224.1-99.6 224.1-222 0-59.3-25.2-115-67.1-157zm-157 341.6c-33.2 0-65.7-8.9-94-25.7l-6.7-4-69.8 18.3L72 359.2l-4.4-7c-18.5-29.4-28.2-63.3-28.2-98.2 0-101.7 82.8-184.5 184.6-184.5 49.3 0 95.6 19.2 130.4 54.1 34.8 34.9 56.2 81.2 56.1 130.5 0 101.8-84.9 184.6-186.6 184.6zm101.2-138.2c-5.5-2.8-32.8-16.2-37.9-18-5.1-1.9-8.8-2.8-12.5 2.8-3.7 5.6-14.3 18-17.6 21.8-3.2 3.7-6.5 4.2-12 1.4-32.6-16.3-54-29.1-75.5-66-5.7-9.8 5.7-9.1 16.3-3